{{!-- Daemonic Immunities badge (#143 — DH2 Errata L69-73).

     A skull pill summarising the three immunities granted by the Daemonic
     trait (disease / poison / Undying). `actor-identity.hbs` overlays it on
     the portrait's bottom edge for actors carrying the trait.

     One line, always (#630), and nothing truncated (#699): the immunities are
     three glyphs, each naming its immunity in its own tooltip, so the pill fits
     the portrait whole. The pill is solid black with light-red text, readable
     on any portrait (it was crimson-on-crimson). The pill's tooltip and its
     accessible name carry the full text.

     Context: rendered only when the parent template gates on
     `isDaemonic` — the partial assumes the gate has already fired
     and emits the badge unconditionally.

     Pure presentation: no actions, no event handlers. Composes with the
     underlying engine helpers in `src/module/rules/daemonic-immunities.ts`. --}}
<div data-wh40k-hook="daemonic-immunities-badge" class="tw-flex tw-min-w-0 tw-max-w-full tw-items-center tw-gap-1 tw-px-1.5 tw-py-0.5 tw-rounded-md tw-border tw-border-solid tw-border-crimson-light tw-bg-black tw-text-crimson-l40 tw-text-[0.65rem] tw-leading-tight tw-font-bold tw-uppercase tw-tracking-wide tw-whitespace-nowrap tw-select-none"
     data-tooltip="{{localize "WH40K.DaemonicImmunities.Tooltip"}}"
     role="img"
     aria-label="{{localize "WH40K.DaemonicImmunities.BadgeLabel"}}: {{localize "WH40K.DaemonicImmunities.DiseaseImmune"}}, {{localize "WH40K.DaemonicImmunities.PoisonImmune"}}, {{localize "WH40K.DaemonicImmunities.Undying"}}">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-skull tw-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <span data-wh40k-hook="daemonic-immunities-badge__label" class="tw-shrink-0">{{localize "WH40K.DaemonicImmunities.BadgeLabel"}}</span>
    <span data-wh40k-hook="daemonic-immunities-badge__immunities" class="tw-flex tw-shrink-0 tw-items-center tw-gap-1 tw-pl-1 tw-border-0 tw-border-l tw-border-solid tw-border-crimson-light">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-virus-slash" data-immunity="disease" data-tooltip="{{localize "WH40K.DaemonicImmunities.DiseaseImmune"}}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-flask-vial" data-immunity="poison" data-tooltip="{{localize "WH40K.DaemonicImmunities.PoisonImmune"}}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-infinity" data-immunity="undying" data-tooltip="{{localize "WH40K.DaemonicImmunities.Undying"}}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </span>
</div>
